---
/** 홈의 시작점: 서비스 소개와 전체 도구로 가는 동작을 한 화면에 둔다. */
import { localeOf } from '../i18n/locales';
import { ui } from '../i18n/ui';
import { siteConfig } from '../site.config';
import { liveTools } from '../tools/registry';

const locale = localeOf(Astro.url.pathname);
const t = ui(locale).home;
---

<section class="local-hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
  <h1 id="home-title">{siteConfig.text[locale].tagline}</h1>
  <p class="intro">{t.localIntro}</p>
  <p class="story-scope">
    {t.story.toolCount(liveTools.length)} · {t.story.offerText}
  </p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a class="primary" href="#tools">
      {t.localPrimary} <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  .home .local-hero {
    padding: clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px) 0 clamp(58px, 7vw, 92px);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .home .local-hero h1 {
    max-width: 14em;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .home .local-hero .intro {
    max-width: 31em;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .home .local-hero .hero-actions {
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .home .story-scope {
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
</style>
